<title>USA: AOL 's Case says starting strong in Japan.</title>
<headline>AOL 's Case says starting strong in Japan.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>America Online Inc is off to a strong start pitching its services in Japan, chairman Steve Case said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We launched in Japan just about a month ago and that's off to a strong start,&quot; Case said during an appearance at the National Press Club here.</p>
<p>The Japan service, announced in March, is a joint venture with Mitsui Co Ltd and newspaper publisher Nihon Keizai Shimbun Inc.</p>
